      "id": "p0193-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In a 1997 English dub of a Dragon Ball Z episode, a villain angrily shouts, \"It's over 9000!\" after checking his opponent's power level. In 2006, the humorous delivery of this English line transformed the quote into an online meme. The quote \"It's over 9000!\" could suddenly be found in countless articles, videos, message boards, and chat rooms. Over time, the quote also began to appear in mainstream English-language entertainment. It also began to appear in video games, including:",
